{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Tophet Hills!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/1f796a6ad89966d1ffb323d4bb14de10.poster.avif?t=1770061666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/1f796a6ad89966d1ffb323d4bb14de10.webm?t=1770061666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/1f796a6ad89966d1ffb323d4bb14de10.mp4?t=1770061666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mors Memora\u00a0</i>is a first-person, nostalgia-driven adventure game that blends light puzzle-solving with an eerie yet familiar atmosphere. Inspired by childhood memories and the feeling of being lost in places that once felt safe, <i>Mors Memora\u00a0</i>takes you on a surreal journey through a mysteriously empty suburban neighborhood frozen in the early 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/d632c16a7f446b2733fd6d943dd47870.avif?t=1770061666\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>The things we get to see here, I know we won't see them anywhere else!</i>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Unreal Engine 5, <i>Mors Memora\u00a0</i>utilizes advanced lighting and rendering technology\u00a0 to create highly detailed, true-to-life environments that capture the warmth\u2014and occasional unease\u2014of a world that was once familiar to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/7e3405693cc3eba27811c5af91f72d23.avif?t=1770061666\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Go out there and search for all of them before dinner!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by your own memories, you\u2019ll search for your missing toys\u2014fragments of your past that hold deeper meaning than you realize. Solve puzzles as you search, using your surroundings\u2014lamplight filtering through blinds, shadows cast by bicycles on the sidewalk\u2014to uncover hidden pathways and forgotten secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/14fb0b7ee5593fa3fa5abc1799b48227.avif?t=1770061666\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Stay safe, sweetie. There have been bad things happening lately\u2026&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you wander further from the familiar glow of porch lights and the soft hum of distant radios, the neighborhood begins to shift.  Beyond the rows of familiar homes, reality bends\u2014vast, empty malls hum with fluorescent lights, winding sewer tunnels echo with distant laughter, and shadows grow in endless fields. The deeper you explore, the more you realize that memory is fragile\u2026 and some places, once forgotten, take on a life of their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/8a06fbfa54a6efc27703e2113ec24b14.poster.avif?t=1770061666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/8a06fbfa54a6efc27703e2113ec24b14.webm?t=1770061666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/8a06fbfa54a6efc27703e2113ec24b14.mp4?t=1770061666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507520?t=1770061666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/e6c1f563b68ea3c29f2167a9bfcfec03930629a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770061666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/aeb4ea4d40c167cc04c9f7e4dec192cd9cb19a4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770061666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/aeb4ea4d40c167cc04c9f7e4dec192cd9cb19a4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770061666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Tophet Hills!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/1f796a6ad89966d1ffb323d4bb14de10.poster.avif?t=1770061666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/1f796a6ad89966d1ffb323d4bb14de10.webm?t=1770061666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/1f796a6ad89966d1ffb323d4bb14de10