u2014to uncover hidden pathways and forgotten secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/14fb0b7ee5593fa3fa5abc1799b48227.avif?t=1770061666\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Stay safe, sweetie. There have been bad things happening lately\u2026&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you wander further from the familiar glow of porch lights and the soft hum of distant radios, the neighborhood begins to shift.  Beyond the rows of familiar homes, reality bends\u2014vast, empty malls hum with fluorescent lights, winding sewer tunnels echo with distant laughter, and shadows grow in endless fields. The deeper you explore, the more you realize that memory is fragile\u2026 and some places, once forgotten, take on a life of their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/8a06fbfa54a6efc27703e2113ec24b14.poster.avif?t=1770061666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/8a06fbfa54a6efc27703e2113ec24b14.webm?t=1770061666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507520/extras/8a06fbfa54a6efc27703e2113ec24b14.mp4?t=1770061666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Court of Elders","Juny Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/